# Allow-list build context (SI1 / D18): the image needs only the package source + its metadata.
# Everything else stays out by construction — candidate data (sessions/, workspace/), logs/,
# caches, .env and other secrets, agent/, design/, documentation*/, examples/, tests/, scripts/,
# docs/ (the demo GIF), portfolio files.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!src/

# ...and never these, even inside the allowed paths.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/sessions
**/workspace
**/.serve.lock
**/*.wav
